{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 2037 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "628ce0ee9728f56e99670927b52ed5c9e14289bb921272395f48717dba94948d" :edb/db-before-t 2036 :edb/db-after-t 2037 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535349 50 #inst "2026-10-08T22:35:01.466Z" 13194139535349 true] [17592186064186 1020 #edb/ref 17592186345199 13194139535349 true] [17592186064186 1020 #edb/ref 17592186345206 13194139535349 true] [17592186345199 1017 #edb/ref 17592186345200 13194139535349 true] [17592186345199 1089 "q-114329" 13194139535349 true] [17592186345199 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535349 true] [17592186345199 1100 "Evaluate the integral ${\\int }_{0}^{1/3}9x{e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139535349 true] [17592186345199 1113 #uuid "55e954dc-2c14-5a02-b400-2dc0fdfc8de1" 13194139535349 true] [17592186345199 1145 "Let's use integration by parts. We set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=9x & ⇒ & {u}^{′}=9 \\\\ {v}^{′}={e}^{-3x} & ⇒ & v=-\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the integration by parts formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int 9x\\cdot {e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x & =9x\\cdot (-\\frac{{e}^{3x}}{3})-\\int (-\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{3})\\cdot 9\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-3x{e}^{-3x}+3\\int {e}^{-3x}\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1/3}9x{e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x & =-3x{e}^{-3x}{|}_{0}^{1/3}+3{\\int }_{0}^{1/3}{e}^{-3x}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-3x{e}^{-3x}{|}_{0}^{1/3}-{e}^{-3x}{|}_{0}^{1/3} \\\\  & =-3[\\frac{1}{3}{e}^{-3(1/3)}-0\\cdot {e}^{-3\\cdot 0}]-[{e}^{-3(1/3)}-{e}^{-3\\cdot 0}] \\\\  & =-3[\\frac{{e}^{-1}}{3}-0]-[{e}^{-1}-1] \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{e}-\\frac{1}{e}+1 \\\\  & =1-\\frac{2}{e} \\\\  & =\\frac{e-2}{e}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535349 true] [17592186345200 1000 #edb/ref 17592186345201 13194139535349 true] [17592186345200 1000 #edb/ref 17592186345202 13194139535349 true] [17592186345200 1000 #edb/ref 1759218634520